{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_05",
  "title": "貨與人",
  "storyCode": "IW-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9924cbcecf364dad1ae1ebebed41ab40db37777218fd023752b0619fd1bdfb56",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "一杯晌午茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "好，尚師傅慢坐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "今天怎麼上工這麼遲？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "一早遇見了個老熟人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "什麼熟人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哎呀，實在沒想到今天又能見到師傅您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "怎麼，還在找那什麼涼亭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "有師傅替我劃出範圍，輕鬆不少，但我要找的，畢竟是人不是亭，還是有點難的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那邊坐著的，是你情人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......什！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "咳，我還沒那膽子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "哦，難不成是你女兒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我哪像是為人父的樣子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "倒也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "喂，你剛剛說什麼！我和這個龍門騙子是什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "一對男女，在早春的這個時間登山，多半是閒得沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "尚師傅，晌午茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "晌午茶？這還沒到晌午吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "凡是在尚蜀山上行走的挑夫，都可以在山腰山腳的茶館白喝兩頓茶水。上午一頓晌午茶，下午一頓日落茶，各送些小菜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "白喝的茶水，滋味總是不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "茶水罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "可畢竟是在山上，山上的茶水，總是貴一些的。那既然是不要錢的，還是賺到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你倒是會算帳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "可店家真的這麼好心？都是做慈善來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "當然是官府掏錢補貼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......你懂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "家裡也是做餐飲生意的，當然懂得多點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "尚蜀官府如此貼心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "梁大人上任之後一直如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "前幾任尚蜀官員，興建土木，開發山林，不僅讓城市從百廢待興中恢復過來，而且變得更加生機勃勃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "到了梁洵梁大人這兒，興許是認為尚蜀已經修葺一新，便把重心轉移到安民厚民之上......這些事，無非是其中最細末的瑣事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......年紀輕輕，懂得不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "家父從商，耳濡目染罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你有個好父親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "茶喝完了，我也該走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "後會有期，尚師傅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "後會有期。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——喂！姓鯉的，酒盞怎麼會在他身上！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "不清楚。但他根本沒有藏的意思，那麼坦蕩蕩掛在腰上，就像是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "故意讓人來找他似的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......罷了，我們也喝壺茶，靜觀其變。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "小二！上兩壺茶，兩碗爛肉麵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我不吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我吃兩碗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "客官，這是兩壺茶水，只是麵要等等，今天人多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "多謝......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "嗷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "怎麼還跟到這裡來了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "呼......嗷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "喂，姓鯉的，問你個事，你別笑話我啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "那茶壺，是不是自己在動......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "爛肉麵來啦——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "好險，差點摔一跤！客官留點神，我這還端著麵呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "嗷嗚？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "......這是個啥？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——喂，你沒事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "那些鍋碗瓢盆，布幌字畫......都從房子裡......跑出來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被嚇到的客人",
      "text": "呀——！這是什麼！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "火！火，這個怪物著了火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......它們是衝著我們來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "喂，姓鯉的！這到底是怎麼回事？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "原來關於那隻酒盞的傳聞竟然是真的......這裡人多，先走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "怎麼聯繫鯉小子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......鯉先生在信裡留言，讓我們會合之後，就去取江峰的山頂找他。如果他沒到，就等他到日落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......好。我們抓緊吧，可不能讓酒盞落入別人手裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人，之前那些與墨魎相似的幻靈，如何是好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "多半和那隻酒盞有關......先去找鯉先生會合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "嗷嗚——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人，它們，是不是，變多了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......？這是什麼品種的野獸？這兩天怎麼總能見到？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "被包圍了呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "嗷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "唔，好凶好凶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "——沒法子了！恩人，你和慎師傅先走，我來應付這些玩意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "——你沒問題嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "和墨魎大抵差不多的路數，還算應付得來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "慎師傅！這邊走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "怎麼了，一副心神不寧的樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......沒什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "你擔心人的時候，總是皺著眉頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "有嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "有的，誰這麼值得梁大人上心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......我在擔心我那位朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "他怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "他入了一個局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "你讓他入的局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "你現在愧疚了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......我還是相信這是最好的選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "只是我不確定......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "你很聰明，梁大人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "算不得聰明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "只是選了個笨法子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......大炎的野獸，都是長這樣的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "......嗷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......嗯？阿燈？啊，不要緊張啦......嗯，有你們陪著我就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "不過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "......！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "鑽頭！就這樣抓住它！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "從沒見過的炎國野獸啊......也許會成為出其不意的陷阱！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "唉！怎麼回事，我最近是命裡犯鬼怪了嗎，怎麼成天要和這些稀奇古怪的生物作對的！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "——唔哦！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "嗚嗷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......定睛細看，這些東西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "嗚——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "（糟糕——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......好險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "先生沒受傷吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "你是，那天的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "勿問。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "太合叔，不必這麼生分......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......你們知道這些東西的來歷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "那隻酒盞所過之處，器倀四起，反而證明了司歲台的猜測。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "這是不是說明......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "公子慎言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......太合叔教訓得是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "嗚嗷——嗚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "（這些幻靈，呃，器倀......是在害怕這兩個人？不，是在害怕這個少年......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "看看這些器倀，這樣的事情發生過幾次？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "十年前一次，二十五年前一次，再前一甲子，仍有數次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "雖說偶有善使源石技藝的惡人鬧事，情況也不比這好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "可歲終究是歲，獸終究是獸，你們若是有心為害天下，天知道會有多大的災難？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀",
      "text": "嗷——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "司歲台不想看到這樣的事情發生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "所以我們要把這筆千年來的糊塗帳算乾淨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......不過是些殘渣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "那些東西......變回普通器具了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "烏有先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "麻煩轉告克洛絲姐姐，還請她再考慮考慮我所說的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "買賣不成仁義在，哪怕最後克洛絲姐姐有自己的考量，那我這裡，也有一個不論身份也想委託羅德島的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "沒問題是沒問題，可那時你為什麼不自己對恩人說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......哈哈，那個時候......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "有點緊張，話沒說全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "公子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "那麼......我們似乎也耽擱不起了，烏有先生，就此告辭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......緊張？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "帶著一個副監察御史到處亂跑的公子哥，也會緊張的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
